/Title (If there's one thing I learned along this whole road, it's this: we are not what happened to us. We are what we decide to do with it. The boy who trembled became a man who chooses. And if my story reached your hands, maybe it's because you, too, have a thunder to outrun and a person to become. Don't be afraid. I didn't know I could either. And here I am.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 321 0 R
/Next 218 0 R
