/Title (When I look back, I see the boy who trembled at lightning. The one who screamed behind a violent man to protect his mother. The one who feared the stranger who turned out to be his real father. The one who had to start over, again and again. And I see that young man in pajamas and flip-flops, crying over three failed subjects.)
