406 0 obj
<<
/Title (How wrong I was. But that story isn't ready to be told yet.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 404 0 R
/Next 408 0 R
>>
endobj
407 0 obj
<<
/Title (And no, it didn't go well. Not at first. The term ended and I had failed three of my four subjects. Three out of four. I remember the exact feeling: the tears, the disappointment in myself, that weight in my chest so familiar, so much like the fear of childhood but with a new name: failure.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 409 0 R
/Next 405 0 R
>>
endobj
408 0 obj
<<
/Title <>
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
