420 0 obj
<<
/Title (I saw things I shouldn't have seen. I won't spell them out, because there are images a person keeps not to remember them, but to learn to carry them in silence. Yet they lodged inside me, and I honestly believe that's where a wound formed that would take me years to even name.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 418 0 R
/Next 422 0 R
>>
endobj
421 0 obj
<<
/Title (University was waiting for me.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 423 0 R
/Next 419 0 R
>>
endobj
422 0 obj
<<
/Title (And then he appeared. The stranger.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 420 0 R
/Next 424 0 R
>>
endobj
423 0 obj
<<
/Title (Five years that passed the way good things pass: far too quickly. And suddenly, almost without noticing, I was standing before a new door. Bigger. More serious. More grown-up.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 425 0 R
/Next 421 0 R
>>
endobj
424 0 obj
<<
/Title <>
