427 0 obj
<<
/Title (I learned so much. And I don't mean only subjects, exams, or grades. I learned to laugh out loud, without glancing over my shoulder waiting for the storm. I learned to trust people. I learned that I, too, could have dreams, goals, a future not defined by what had happened to me, but by what I chose to do with it.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 429 0 R
/Next 425 0 R
>>
endobj
428 0 obj
<<
/Title (So I watched him arrive, convinced he was bringing a storm.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 426 0 R
/Next 430 0 R
>>
endobj
429 0 obj
<<
/Title <>
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
