>>
endobj
430 0 obj
<<
/Title (I didn't know he was bringing, for the very first time, calm.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 428 0 R
/Next 432 0 R
>>
endobj
431 0 obj
<<
/Title (It's a strange thing. The same boy who had grown up measuring danger, bracing for shouts, carrying wounds too heavy for his age, found in those classrooms something he'd never had in such abundance: people. Real friends. People who crossed my path to teach me, each in their own way, something I needed to learn.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 433 0 R
/Next 429 0 R
>>
endobj
432 0 obj
<<
/Title <>
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 430 0 R
/Next 434 0 R
>>
endobj
433 0 obj
<<
/Title (It was five years. And I dare say, without exaggerating, they were the best years in the world.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 435 0 R
/Next 431 0 R
>>
endobj
